                 rdfs:comment "Indicates single/dual hand usage in a technique. Controlled values (managed as SKOS concepts in MAon_cv.ttl): 单手 | 双手 | 双手交替 | 单手或双手. Not applicable to lower-limb-only techniques."@en ;
                 rdfs:label "employsHands"@en ,
                            "手部使用方式"@zh .


